{"id":"word:hebrew:H7355","type":"word","title":"רָחַם","subtitle":"H7355 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"to fondle ; by implication, to love , especially to compassionate","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to רָחַם (H7355) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 47 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"רָחַם (râcham) means to fondle ; by implication, to love , especially to compassionate First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 8 50."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"רָחַם","transliteration":"râcham","pronunciation":"raw-kham'","strong":"H7355","lemmaId":"hebrew:H7355","partOfSpeech":"v","forms":["יְרַחֵ֔מוּ","וְ/רִֽחַמְתִּ֖י","רַחֵ֥ם","אֲרַחֵ֑ם","יְרַחֵֽם"],"morphs":[["HVpi1cs",6],["HVpi3ms",4],["HC/Vpq1cs",3],["HVpi3mp",3],["HC/Vpq3ms/Sp2ms",2],["HVpa",2],["HVPi3ms",2],["HR/Vpc",2],["HVpp1cs/Sp2fs",2],["HC/Vpq1cs/Sp3mp",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"to fondle ; by implication, to love , especially to compassionate","usage":"have compassion (on, upon), love, (find, have, obtain, shew) mercy(-iful, on, upon), (have) pity, Ruhamah, × surely.","full":"H7355. racham [ רָחַם ] verb denominative love . Pi`el have compassion ; — Qal Imperfect 1 singular suffix אֶרְחָֽמְךָ Psa 18:2 I love thee (perhaps gloss; see not in || 2Sam 22:2 ; Hi Ch SS Gerber read אֲרֹמִמְךָ ). Pi`el Perfect 3masculine singular רִחַם Psa 103:13 +; suffix וְרִחַמְךָ consecutive Deut 13:18 , etc.; Imperfect 3masculine singular יְרַחֵם Isa 9:16 +; suffix יְרַחֲמֵהוּ 55:7 , etc.; Infinitive absolute רַחְֵ Jer 31:20 ; Hab 3:2 ; construct רַחֵם Isa 49:15 ; Psa 103:13 ; suffix רַחֶמְכֶם Isa 30:18 ; Participle מְרַחֵם Psa 116:5 , etc.; &#8212; have compassion, compassionate ; — 1 usually of God: with accusative of his people , Exod 33:19 (twice in verse) (J) Deut 13:18 ; 30:3 ; 2Kin 13:23 ; Isa 9:16 ; 14:1 ; 27:11 ; 30:18 ; 49:10 , 13 ; 54:8 , 10 ; 55:7 ; 60:10 ; Jer 12:15 ; 30:18 ; 31:20 (twice in verse); 33:26 ; Ezek 39:25 ; Hosea 1:6-7 , 2:6 ; Hosea 2:25; Micah 7:19 ; Zech 1:12 ; 10:6 ; Psa 102:14 ; with עַל 103:13 ; absolute Jer 13:14 ; Hab 3:2 ; Psa 116:5 ; Lam 3:32 . 2 of man, usually a conqueror: with accusative 1Kin 8:50 ; Jer 42:12 ; absolute 6:23 ; 21:7 ; 50:42 ; elsewhere of children, with accusative Isa 13:18 ; 49:15 ; with עַל Psa 103:13 . Pu`al Perfect 3feminine singular רֻחָ֑מָה Hosea 2:3 ; Hosea 2:25 (Ges § 152a N. Kö i. 270 ); — Imperfect 3masculine singular יְרֻחַם 14:4 ; יְרֻחָ֑ם Prov 28:13 ; be shewn compassion, compassionated: of orphans Hosea 14:4 ; children of Israel wife of Yahweh 2:3 ; Hosea 2:25 (compare ׳לארֿ 1:6 , 8 , p. 520); penitent sinner Prov 28:13 .","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 8 50","keyReferences":["1Kgs 8 50","2Kgs 13 23","Deut 13 18","Deut 30 3","Exod 33 19","Exod 33 19","Ezek 39 25","Hab 3 2"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":47,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 8 50","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":50,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/רִֽחֲמֽוּ/ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vpq3cp/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"2Kgs 13 23","book":"2Kgs","chapter":13,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַֽ/יְרַחֲמֵ/ם֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vpw3ms/Sp3mp"},{"reference":"Deut 13 18","book":"Deut","chapter":13,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/רִֽחַמְ/ךָ֣","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vpq3ms/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"Deut 30 3","book":"Deut","chapter":30,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/רִחֲמֶ֑/ךָ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vpq3ms/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"Exod 33 19","book":"Exod","chapter":33,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/רִחַמְתִּ֖י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vpq1cs"},{"reference":"Exod 33 19","book":"Exod","chapter":33,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֲרַחֵֽם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVpi1cs"},{"